  "bodyText": "Skip to content\nTotal items in cart: 0\nYOUR CART IS EMPTY\n\nHave an account? Log in to check out faster.\n\nContinue shopping\nBONDING ROSE BLAZER\nXS/34\n$2,800.00\nSkip to product information\n1\n2\n3\n4\nBONDING ROSE BLAZER\n$2,800.00\nSize\nXS/34\nS/36\nM/38\nL/40\nXL/42\nDecrease quantity\nIncrease quantity\nAdd to cart\nBuy it now\n\nThis is a demonstration store. You can purchase products like this from Seen Users.\n\nThe Bonding Rose Blazer is a slightly oversized, boxy-shaped blazer, that cinches the waist through a rose on a long soft stem, acting as either a belt or a styling piece. The blazer is covered in hand-crafted leather roses.\n\n\n\n\nGOES WELL WITH...\nChest Rose Leather Blazer\nSALE\nCHEST ROSE LEATHER BLAZER\nSale price \n$1,840.00 \nRegular price \n$2,300.00\nWild Rose Leather Blazer\nSALE\nWILD ROSE LEATHER BLAZER\nSale price \n$2,000.00 \nRegular price \n$2,500.00\nChest Rose Denim Blazer\nSALE\nCHEST ROSE DENIM BLAZER\nSale price \n$1,000.00 \nRegular price \n$2,000.00\nDenim Rose Blazer\nSALE\nDENIM ROSE BLAZER\nSale price \n$1,100.00 \nRegular price \n$2,200.00\nBestsellers 39\nDresses 6\nTops 17\nAccessories 4\nBottoms 30\nDenim 20\nSHOP\nShop all\nBestsellers\nNew arrivals\nBRAND\nAbout us\nBlog\nShipping & Returns\nFit guide\nCONNECT\nInstagram\nTikTok\nFacebook\nContact us\n\nGET ON THE LIST\n\nEmail\nOK\nRitual\n© 2026 Ritual, Powered by Shopify"
